  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given an integer sequence A=(A1,A2,…,AN)A=(A_1, A_2,\\dots, A_N)A=(A1​,A2​,…,AN​) of length NNN and an integer MMM such that 0≤M&lt;∑i=1NAi0 \\leq M \\lt \\sum\\limits_{i=1}^N A_i0≤M&lt;i=1∑N​Ai​.\n\nAn integer sequence B=(B1,B2,…,BN)B=(B_1, B_2,\\dots, B_N)B=(B1​,B2​,…,BN​) of length NNN is called good if:\n\n\n0≤Bi≤Ai0 \\le B_i \\le A_i0≤Bi​≤Ai​ for each 1≤i≤N1\\le i \\le N1≤i≤N\nB1+B2+⋯+BN=MB_1+ B_2+\\dots+B_N=MB1​+B2​+⋯+BN​=M\nFind the **maximum** value of gcd⁡(A1−B1,A2−B2,…,AN−BN)\\gcd(A_1-B_1,A_2-B_2,\\dots,A_N-B_N)gcd(A1​−B1​,A2​−B2​,…,AN​−BN​) over all good sequences BBB. Here, gcd⁡\\gcdgcd denotes  the greatest common divisor.\n\n**Note:** gcd⁡(a,b,c)=gcd⁡(a,gcd⁡(b,c))\\gcd(a,b,c) = \\gcd(a,\\gcd(b,c))gcd(a,b,c)=gcd(a,gcd(b,c)) and gcd⁡(a,0)=gcd⁡(0,a)=a\\gcd(a,0)=\\gcd(0,a)=agcd(a,0)=gcd(0,a)=a.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input contains a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases. The description of TTT test cases follows.\nThe first line of each test case contains two space-separated integers N,MN, MN,M.\nThe second line of each test case contains NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\dots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, print a single line containing one integer — the **maximum** value of gcd⁡(A1−B1,A2−B2,…,AN−BN)\\gcd(A_1-B_1,A_2-B_2,\\dots,A_N-B_N)gcd(A1​−B1​,A2​−B2​,…,AN​−BN​) over all good sequences BBB.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤101 \\leq T \\leq 101≤T≤10",
      "1≤N≤1051 \\leq N \\leq 10^51≤N≤105",
      "1≤Ai≤1051 \\leq A_i \\leq 10^51≤Ai​≤105",
      "0≤M&lt;∑i=1NAi0 \\leq M \\lt \\sum\\limits_{i=1}^N A_i0≤M&lt;i=1∑N​Ai​",
      "Subtasks",
      "**Subtask #1 (50 points):** 1≤N≤1041 \\leq N \\leq 10^41≤N≤104",
      "**Subtask #2 (50 points):** Original constraints"
    ],
